    "detailed_description": "Settlers from the Old Powers settled the colony of New Albans in the New World in search of treasure and prestige. 6 months on, neither are found. Instead the townsfolk are beset with issues that hinder all progress, most notably are the rising tensions with the native tribes: Karok and Saponi.<br><br>Brought in to initially help the Governor. It will be up to you to decide the fate of the colony of New Albans, how will you handle the current threats?<br><br><br>         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383870/extras/9b2022e62fa9afc78be45208af26f7ee.avif?t=1713626445\" /></span><br><br>Soon after arriving, you may shape the future of these lands by choosing who to side with. Assist the inhabitants of both New Albans and the tribal natives to increase your reputation with each faction by completing tasks and puzzles. Determine the outcome of an emerging conflict and forge your own experience.<br><br><br>         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383870/extras/0832e08e0e10b1163884fad5aaa97c0c.avif?t=1713626445\" /></span><br><br>Explore the lands in and around New Albans. Meet and interact with dozens of NPCs who will require your help. Engage in dialogue to learn more about each faction and individual which will help make your choices.<br><br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Choices have consequences:</strong> Make choices based on your experiences with the townsfolk of New Albans and the natives of Karok and Saponi. What faction will you support?<br></li><li> <strong>Tasks and puzzles:</strong> Be of service to the Governor and tribe Chiefs by taking on quests and tackling puzzles.<br></li><li> <strong>Every decision you make is final:</strong> Many quests and events can lead to a choice at the end which will impact your standing with that faction. The autosave feature does not allow loading of previous saves. You must make choices carefully. <br></li><li> <strong>How will you determine the Fate of New Albans?:</strong> Ultimately, it is down to you to determine the fate of these lands, your actions can result in one of 3 diiferent major endings.</li></ul>",
